{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54120","headline":"天门灵泉院 · 周朴","name":"天门灵泉院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华亭参後最幽玄，一句能教万古传。\n猿抱子归青嶂後，鸟衔花落碧崖前。\n虽知物理无穷际，却恐沧溟有尽年。\n爲报五湖云外客，何妨来此老林泉。\n（按：《沅湘耆旧集》卷八云：「琮案：元慈利张兑《天门山图诗》末云：『可怜宜都周内史，古冢累累在山址。\n感时抚景亦怆然，周朴小诗何足拟？\n』即指此诗也。\n次联爲中和间僧传明语。\n传明即善会，自鹤林入夹山，有僧问如何是夹山境，答以猿抱子归云云，朴即用其语也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}